{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31484","headline":"送郑子宽弃官东游便归女几 · 李羣玉","name":"送郑子宽弃官东游便归女几","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"八月湖浸天，扬帆入秋色。\n岷峨雪气来，寒涨潇湘碧。\n子真冥鸿志，不逐笼下翼。\n九女叠云屏，於焉恣栖息。\n新诗山水思，静入陶谢格。\n困醉松花春，追攀紫烟客。\n相逢十年旧，嚬笑等欢慽。\n一饭玉露蔬，中肠展堆积。\n停食不尽意，倾意怅可惜。\n云水一分飞，离忧洞庭侧。\n回车三乡路，仙菊正堪摘。\n寄谢杜兰香，何年别张硕。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李羣玉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31484.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31484","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}